WEBVTT

00:36:57.454 --> 00:37:00.954
What I learned is that that would be,
you know, a regular thing like that.

00:37:00.954 --> 00:37:02.663
I would many, many times go three,

00:37:02.663 --> 00:37:05.288
four or five days without another
seeing another person.

00:37:05.788 --> 00:37:10.704
There was no way to contact anyone except
if I came upon a payphone or if

00:37:10.704 --> 00:37:14.121
I sent them a letter. Right. I'm
so grateful for that world.

00:37:14.871 --> 00:37:18.496
I mean, I'm so grateful that I took
my hike during that time because

00:37:18.496 --> 00:37:21.413
I think had I not done that, I would
have spent a lot of time.

00:37:22.329 --> 00:37:28.246
Tweeting at people in town, right,
connecting great pictures, the fox,

00:37:28.246 --> 00:37:31.913
I mean, yeah, and getting feedback
from people. Right.